-reports\",\"content\":\"The Pi extension listens to Pi lifecycle events. It publishes an Agent Report when the session starts, runs, becomes idle, uses a tool, or shuts down.\"}],[\"/how-it-works-17\",{\"id\":\"/how-it-works-17\",\"page_id\":\"/how-it-works\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/how-it-works#1-pi-writes-reports\",\"content\":\"Each report contains the agent state, pane ID, tab data, working directory, model, title, and update time.\"}],[\"/how-it-works-18\",{\"id\":\"/how-it-works-18\",\"page_id\":\"/how-it-works\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/how-it-works#1-pi-writes-reports\",\"content\":\"On shutdown, the extension deletes the row instead of writing a closed row.\"}],[\"/how-it-works-19\",{\"id\":\"/how-it-works-19\",\"page_id\":\"/how-it-works\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/how-it-works#2-pi-wakes-the-plugin\",\"content\":\"After a store write, the Pi extension sends a Zellij pipe message.\"}],[\"/how-it-works-20\",{\"id\":\"/how-it-works-20\",\"page_id\":\"/how-it-works\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/how-it-works#2-pi-wakes-the-plugin\",\"content\":\"This message does not carry the agent list. It only tells the plugin to read the store.\"}],[\"/how-it-works-21\",{\"id\":\"/how-it-works-21\",\"page_id\":\"/how-it-works\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/how-it-works#2-pi-wakes-the-plugin\",\"content\":\"The extension also calls `zellij action list-panes --json`. It uses this data to add pane and tab metadata to the report.\"}],[\"/how-it-works-22\",{\"id\":\"/how-it-works-22\",\"page_id\":\"/how-it-works\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/how-it-works#3-the-store-keeps-one-row-per-agent-location\",\"content\":\"The CLI stores reports in SQLite. The row key uses the Zellij pane when it exists.\"}],[\"/how-it-works-23\",{\"id\":\"/how-it-works-23\",\"page_id\":\"/how-it-works\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/how-it-works#3-the-store-keeps-one-row-per-agent-location\",\"content\":\"