nt-threads\",\"content\":\"Zellij Agent Threads shows agents inside Zellij.\"}],[\"/why-13\",{\"id\":\"/why-13\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-zellij-agent-threads\",\"content\":\"It gives you a sidebar or floating panel that lists agents running anywhere in the current Zellij session, across panes and tabs.\"}],[\"/why-14\",{\"id\":\"/why-14\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"Agent work spreads across tabs, panes, and worktrees. After a few prompts, it gets hard to tell what is still running and where it lives.\"}],[\"/why-15\",{\"id\":\"/why-15\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"You need one terminal-native view that answers:\"}],[\"/why-16\",{\"id\":\"/why-16\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"which agents are running?\"}],[\"/why-17\",{\"id\":\"/why-17\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"which agents are idle?\"}],[\"/why-18\",{\"id\":\"/why-18\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"which tab are they in?\"}],[\"/why-19\",{\"id\":\"/why-19\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"which worktree are they using?\"}],[\"/why-20\",{\"id\":\"/why-20\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-problem\",\"content\":\"what belongs to this Zellij session?\"}],[\"/why-21\",{\"id\":\"/why-21\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-default-view\",\"content\":\"The default list groups agents by tab:\"}],[\"/why-22\",{\"id\":\"/why-22\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#the-default-view\",\"content\":\"Example:\"}],[\"/why-23\",{\"id\":\"/why-23\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\"